msgstr ""

#: ../../using/configure.rst:805
msgid ""
"Frame pointers enable profilers, debuggers, and system tracing tools "
"(``perf``, ``eBPF``, ``dtrace``, ``gdb``) to walk the C call stack without "
"DWARF metadata. The flags propagate to third-party C extensions "
"through :mod:`sysconfig`. On compilers that do not understand them, the "
"build silently skips them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../using/configure.rst:811
msgid ""
"Downstream packagers and authors of native libraries built with custom build "
